---
description: ONI SDK csproj and Klei yaml packaging
globs: "**/*.csproj,**/mod.yaml,**/mod_info.yaml"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Project files

- SDK-style, `netstandard2.1`, `HarmonyLib`, game refs `Private=false`.
- `GameLibs` = `E:\Steam\steamapps\common\OxygenNotIncluded\OxygenNotIncluded_Data\Managed`
- `OutputPath` = `$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\..\..\local\<ModName>\`
- AfterBuild: copy `packaging/mod.yaml`, `mod_info.yaml`, `translations/`, extra assets.
- `mod.yaml`: `title`, `description`, `staticID` like `DarrenLee.<Name>`
- `mod_info.yaml`: `supportedContent: ALL`, `APIVersion: 2`, `minimumSupportedBuild` from current game (not 449549-era)
- Ignore MSB3277 on `System.IO.Compression` / `System.Net.Http` unless the build fails
- Add Unity `*Module` refs only when the compiler asks
